            "target_entity_instance": "Drought",
            "target_entity_type": "NaturalHazardType",
            "paragraph": "In Nigeria, droughts can occur even in regions that typically receive adequate rainfall. As one of the most complex and catastrophic disasters, drought is characterized by a prolonged reduction in precipitation, leading to significant environmental and socio-economic impacts.",
